WEBVTT

00:00:58.621 --> 00:01:01.912
short for “Rossum’s Universal Robots.”

00:01:03.871 --> 00:01:08.663
The story featured automated machines
with distinctly human traits

00:01:08.663 --> 00:01:10.538
that, until they revolt,

00:01:10.538 --> 00:01:13.079
catered to the whims of the earthlings.

00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:16.204
Originally, Capek had considered

00:01:16.204 --> 00:01:18.538
calling these hard-working machines labori

00:01:18.538 --> 00:01:20.371
from the Latin word for labor,

00:01:21.704 --> 00:01:24.621
but he was afraid that it would ring
a little too academic.

00:01:24.621 --> 00:01:28.163
He opted, instead,
to emphasize their enslaved state

00:01:28.163 --> 00:01:29.913
by naming them “roboti”,

00:01:29.913 --> 00:01:32.663
or robot in English [and in French].